Association EducationOrganizationInterventionPrescriptionAssociation
    documentation 'This association indicates interventions made available by an education 
                  'organization. Often, a district-level education organization purchases a set of 
                  'intervention prescriptions and makes them available to its schools for use 
                  'on demand.
    domain entity EducationOrganization
        documentation 'The EducationalOrganization, often times a district, which is making the 
                      'InterventionPrescription available to its hierarchy. In some cases, it may be an 
                      'education organization network instead of a district.
    domain entity InterventionPrescription
        documentation 'The InterventionPrescription being made available by the EducationOrganization.
        with context InterventionPrescription
    date BeginDate
        documentation 'The begin date of the period during which the InterventionPrescription is 
                      'available.
        is optional
    date EndDate
        documentation 'The end date of the period during which the InterventionPrescription is 
                      'available.
        is optional